      "height": 230,
      "text": "```json\n{\n  \"paperstream\": 1,\n  \"name\": \"Inhomogeneous Electron Gas\",\n  \"alias\": \"Hohenberg–Kohn · DFT 理论基础\",\n  \"takeaway\": \"- 以基态电子密度组织多体问题。\\n- 为后续 DFT 方法提供理论基础。\",\n  \"url\": \"https://journals.aps.org/pr/abstract/10.1103/PhysRev.136.B864\",\n  \"year\": 1964\n}\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "ks-1965",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "```json\n{\n  \"paperstream\": 1,\n  \"name\": \"Self-Consistent Equations Including Exchange and Correlation Effects\",\n  \"alias\": \"Kohn–Sham · 自洽方程\",\n  \"takeaway\": \"- 用自洽单粒子方程处理交换与关联效应。\\n- 区分理论框架、泛函近似和具体数值实现。\",\n  \"url\": \"https://journals.aps.org/pr/abstract/10.1103/PhysRev.140.A1133\",\n  \"year\": 1965\n}\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "deeph-2022",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 840,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "```json\n{\n  \"paperstream\": 1,\n  \"name\": \"Deep-learning density functional theory Hamiltonian for efficient ab initio electronic-structure calculation\",\n  \"alias\": \"DeepH · 学习 DFT Hamiltonian\",\n  \"takeaway\": \"- 从结构学习局域 DFT 哈密顿量。\\n- 关注预测矩阵而非仅预测标量能量的意义。\",\n  \"url\": \"https://www.nature.com/articles/s43588-022-00265-6\",\n  \"year\": 2022\n}\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "deeph-e3-2023",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1260,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "```json\n{\n  \"paperstream\": 1,\n  \"name\": \"General framework for E(3)-equivariant neural network representation of density functional theory Hamiltonian\",\n  \"alias\": \"DeepH-E3 · 显式等变表示\",\n  \"takeaway\": \"- 在神经网络中显式满足 E(3) 等变要求。\\n- 阅读时对照坐标变换、自旋轨道耦合与训练数据。\",\n  \"url\": \"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-023-38468-8\",\n  \"year\": 2023\n}\n```"
    }
